"""
## Purpose and audience
Pins the observable CLI behavior of this spec's target so maintainers and
reviewers of the std_benchmark area can rely on documented output and exit codes.
## Operator workflow
Run via `bin/simple test <this file>`; read the per-scenario verdicts in the
`Results:` summary. Every scenario asserts an externally visible outcome.
## Compatibility and limitations
Covers the shipped command surface only; performance and stress behavior are
out of scope.
# @manual: primary
REQ-LIB-STD-001
doc/01_research/local/std_benchmark.md
doc/03_plan/sys_test/std_benchmark.md
doc/04_architecture/std_benchmark.md
doc/05_design/std_benchmark.md
